ment reached $488 billion in 2023, with developing countries receiving record levels of clean energy financing.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-01-25/renewable-energy-investment-reaches-record-488-billion-globally\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Energy storage systems, particularly battery storage, are projected to grow at an annual rate of 24% through 2030 as costs continue to decline.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/batteries-and-secure-energy-transitions\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"China installed 180 GW of new renewable capacity in 2023, representing over 40% of global renewable capacity additions.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/articles/china-leads-global-renewable-electricity-capacity-expansion\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
