ated renewable energy hubs in coastal regions\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy20osti/75598.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"The geothermal industry is exploring transcritical and supercritical CO2 cycles as working fluids to improve efficiency in enhanced geothermal systems (EGS)\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0360544221008987\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Integration of offshore wind and geothermal energy faces technical challenges including grid interconnection, resource assessment, and site-specific geological characterization\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy22osti/82144.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
