      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"subtopic\": \"Energy Storage Systems (Batteries, Mechanical, Thermal)\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Lithium-ion batteries dominate the energy storage market and are increasingly used in grid-scale applications, with global battery storage capacity reaching over 20 GWh in 2023\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-energy-storage-database\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Pumped hydro storage accounts for approximately 90% of global energy storage capacity, making it the most widely deployed mechanical energy storage technology\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.irena.org/publications/2020/May/Electricity-storage-and-renewables-costs-and-markets\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Thermal energy storage systems, including molten salt and phase-change materials, can store energy for 10-15 hours and are increasingly used with concentrated solar power plants\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/csp/solarpaces-database.html\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"The global battery storage market is expected to grow from 9 GWh in 2020 to over 100 GWh annually by 2030\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/global-ev-outlook-2023\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Compressed air energy storage (CAES) and advanced adiabatic CAES systems can provide large-scale storage capacity of 50-300 MW with round-trip efficiencies of 40-70%\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/compressed-air-energy-storage\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Solid-state batteries using lithium metal anodes and solid electrolytes are in development stage with potential to increase energy density by 50-100% compared to conventional lithium-ion batteries\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/news/program/2023/solid-state-battery.html\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Flow batteries, including vanadium redox and zinc-bromine types, offer modular energy storage with round-trip efficiencies of 70-80% and are suitable for durations of 4-12 hours\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/long-duration-storage-shot\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Thermal storage costs are significantly lower than battery storage, ranging from $15-$40 per kWh for molten salt systems compared to $100-$200 per kWh for lithium-ion batteries\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.irena.org/publications/2021/Jun/Renewable-Power-Generation-Costs-in-2021\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Gravity energy storage systems, using suspended weights in towers or mines, are emerging technologies with potential capacities of 1-10 MWh and round-trip efficiencies of 80-90%\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/gravity-energy-storage-systems\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
