 CO2 over a 100-year period\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.epa.gov/anaerobic-digestion\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Sustainable biomass sourcing requires careful management to avoid deforestation, land-use change, and competition with food crops\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.worldwildlife.org/industries/sustainable-biomass\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"The European Union's renewable energy directive requires that by 2030, at least 42.5% of energy consumption come from renewable sources, with biomass playing a significant role\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.europarl.europa.eu/news/en/headlines/society/20230621STO85804\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Palm oil biodiesel production has expanded significantly but raises sustainability concerns related to deforestation and biodiversity loss\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iucn.org/resources/issues/palm-oil\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
