      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"subtopic\": \"Energy Efficiency and Demand Management\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Energy efficiency improvements can reduce overall energy consumption by 10-30% in buildings through better insulation, HVAC systems, and smart controls, making it one of the most cost-effective strategies for reducing energy demand.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/energy-efficiency-2023\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Demand-side management (DSM) programs that shift electricity consumption from peak to off-peak hours can reduce peak demand by 5-15%, helping to balance renewable energy intermittency and reduce infrastructure strain.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy19osti/72565.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Smart meters and real-time energy pricing mechanisms enable consumers to reduce energy consumption by 10-20% through behavioral changes and automated responses to price signals.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0140673621004695\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Industrial energy efficiency improvements, particularly in manufacturing sectors, can achieve 20-40% energy savings through process optimization, waste heat recovery, and advanced motor systems.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/industrial-energy-efficiency-2022\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Demand response programs that incentivize flexible electricity consumption during periods of high renewable generation can improve renewable energy integration by 15-25%.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy21osti/80410.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Building-integrated energy management systems combined with distributed renewable generation can reduce grid electricity demand by 30-50% in optimized configurations.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/ese3.956\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Vehicle-to-grid (V2G) technology and electric vehicle charging management can provide 10-20 GW of flexible load capacity in markets with high EV adoption rates.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-021-00860-3\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Energy storage systems combined with demand management can enable grid operators to handle 60-80% renewable energy penetration while maintaining reliability.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy21osti/78773.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"LED lighting upgrades and appliance efficiency standards have contributed to a decoupling of electricity growth from GDP growth in developed economies since 2010.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/energy-efficiency-trends-and-policies-2023\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Machine learning algorithms can optimize demand forecasting and automated response systems, improving demand prediction accuracy by 20-35% compared to traditional methods.\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.14117\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
