\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/lpo/battery-manufacturing-and-recycling\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"According to ILO reports, female participation in renewable energy manufacturing remains below 30% globally, indicating potential for workforce diversification\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.ilo.org/wcmsp5/groups/public/---ed_emp/documents/publication/wcms_837342.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Supply chain localization and nearshoring of renewable energy component manufacturing is increasing in response to trade policies and inflation reduction acts\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.mckinsey.com/industries/electric-power-and-natural-gas/our-insights/\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
