ultural-outlook/\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Sustainable biomass sourcing requires adherence to environmental standards to avoid negative impacts on land use and biodiversity\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.fao.org/bioenergy/\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Anaerobic digestion of biomass can produce biogas containing methane and carbon dioxide, usable for electricity and heat generation\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/bioenergy/anaerobic-digestion\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Biomass direct combustion contributes approximately 60% of renewable heating globally as of 2022\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/renewable-heat\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
