dium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy jobs globally exceeded 12.7 million in 2023, with solar photovoltaics being the largest employer\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.irena.org/publications/2024-Jun/Renewable-Energy-Jobs-Report-2024\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
