 \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"The global biofuels market is projected to grow at a CAGR of 5-7% through 2030, driven by renewable energy mandates and net-zero commitments\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/reports/renewables-2023\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
