      "text": "```json\n{\n  \"subtopic\": \"Environmental and social impacts of renewable energy\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy technologies significantly reduce greenhouse gas emissions compared to fossil fuels, with lifecycle assessments showing solar and wind have emissions 4-8 times lower than coal over their lifetime\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.ipcc.ch/report/ar6/wg3/\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Large-scale renewable energy projects can impact land use and biodiversity, particularly wind farms affecting bird and bat populations and solar installations requiring significant land conversion\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nature.com/articles/nature12373\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy development creates employment opportunities, with solar and wind industries employing significantly more workers per unit of energy produced than fossil fuel industries\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.irena.int/publications/renewable-energy-jobs-annual-review\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Mining and processing of materials for renewable energy technologies (lithium, cobalt, rare earth elements) can cause environmental degradation and water pollution\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.unep.org/resources/report/critical-materials-clean-energy-transition\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy transitions can negatively impact workers and communities dependent on fossil fuel industries without proper just transition policies and economic diversification support\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.iea.org/articles/just-energy-transition-partnership\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy deployment can improve energy access and energy security in remote and developing regions, reducing dependence on imported fossil fuels\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.worldbank.org/en/topic/energy/brief/clean-energy\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Hydroelectric projects can disrupt aquatic ecosystems and displace indigenous communities and local populations from traditional lands\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://academic.oup.com/icesjms/article/76/6/1522/5571149\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Solar panel and wind turbine recycling presents both environmental challenges and opportunities for resource recovery, with current recycling rates varying widely by region\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0963996921001782\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Renewable energy can reduce air pollution and associated health costs, preventing millions of premature deaths annually compared to fossil fuel-based energy systems\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240039995\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Grid integration of variable renewable energy sources requires investment in energy storage and transmission infrastructure with potential environmental and social trade-offs\",\n      \"source_url\": \"https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy21osti/80643.pdf\",\n      \"confidence\": \"medium\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
